{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34726","headline":"和胥口即事 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和胥口即事 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把钓丝随浪远，采莲衣染香浓。\n绿倒红飘欲尽，风斜雨细相逢。\n断岸沈渔𦋥𦊲，邻村送客𦪽{舟\n即是清霜剖野，乘闲莫厌来重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}